    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοιδ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swell</i> or <i>be swollen up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγαῖς πρόσωπον . . ἐξῳδηκότα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					227
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκρὸς ἐξῳδηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					14.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				24(44).44
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>swell beyond its proper size,</i> of a body
			in the state, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.18.7
			</span></i>.</div>
